implementation starts.

## Correction from the first draft

The first draft of this plan treated `01_struct_skeleton` as a from-scratch
port, the same way `00_config` was. That was wrong: the user has already
copied the completed `week1_baseline/python/00_config` port verbatim into
`week1_baseline/python/01_struct_skeleton` as a starting scaffold (confirmed
below — every file is byte-identical to its `00_config` counterpart). The
actual porting work is only the **delta** between the two Ruby steps, applied
on top of that copy — not a full re-port. This revision restructures the plan
around that delta.

